// "double <subject>'s power and toughness [<duration>]": Doubling a creature's power and toughness gives it +X/+Y, X its power and Y its toughness [CR#701.10b,701.10c]. One expansion of the
// "double" keyword action, which has several, chosen by what is doubled
// [CR#701.10a,701.11a].
(
    name: "doublePowerAndToughness",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"subject": Subject, "duration": Default(Any, None)},
    body: Establish(PtModification(Param(subject), up(powerOf(Param(subject))), up(toughnessOf(Param(subject)))), Param(duration)),
)
